{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02831","headline":"哭金部韦郎中 · 卢照邻","name":"哭金部韦郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金曹初受拜，玉地始含香。\n翻同五日尹，遽见一星亡。\n贺客犹扶路，哀人遂上堂。\n歌筵长寂寂，哭位自苍苍。\n岁时宾径断，朝暮雀罗张。\n书留魏主阙，魂掩汉家牀。\n徒令永平帝，千载罢撞郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02831.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02831","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}